description:
Drive a Moscow metro train, transport passengers, explore stations!
• Metro lines:
- Kalininskaya (8) (Tretyakovskaya, Marksistskaya, Ploshchad Ilyicha, Aviamotornaya, Shosse Entuziastov, Perovo, Novogireyevo, Novokosino)

• Trains:
- "Nomernoy" 81-717/714;
- "Oka" 81-760/761;
- Wagon type "E" 81-703;
- "Moscow" 81-765/766.

• Informant: the real records of the informant of the Moscow metro.

• Game Modes:
- Driver mode: control the Moscow metro train;
- Training: learn how to drive a train.

- A casual arcade game with simple and intuitive controls;
- Gather resources to build a farm;
- Chop trees to get wood;
- Chop rocks to get stone;
- Dig a well to get water;
- Breed animals to collect fertilizer for your plants;
- Build a mill;
- Harvest wheat and process it into flour;
- Bake bread and hire helpers.
